1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,420
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:53,119
Right away, sir.

4
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:54,320
May I ask

5
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,039
who that person is?

6
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,759
Even the Xuanwu Sect
treads lightly around her.

7
00:00:58,759 --> 00:00:59,560
Enjoy.

8
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,399
She is Fengniang.

9
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:03,079
Legend says she was born deep
within the Wilds of Lize.

10
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,159
Her origins are a complete mystery.

11
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:07,680
She has information on everything.

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,799
Money can buy many things,

13
00:01:09,159 --> 00:01:10,959
but you should never cross her.

14
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,760
Or she'll have you banished
from the Wilds of Lize.

15
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,439
Lanxi.

16
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,319
It's really you!

17
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,439
I thought I'd never see you again.

18
00:01:26,756 --> 00:01:28,560
(One Month Earlier)

19
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:35,760
Lanxi.

20
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:43,799
The Stone Curse is getting worse.

21
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:45,359
If this keeps up,

22
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,519
you'll have to fight it back
every full moon.

23
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:50,400
Otherwise,

24
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:53,319
the Curse will consume you completely.

25
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:57,920
It is okay.

26
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,000
Once I find the cure,

27
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,280
I'll be free of this Curse for good.

28
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:07,040
No more suffering.

29
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:09,520
The cure...

30
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:13,639
We sisters have seen
countless men in Lanruo Hall.

31
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,080
Not once have we found

32
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,879
the man with your bite mark.

33
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,319
I'm sorry, Lanxi.

34
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,960
I've made you worry again.

35
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,719
You will be fine.

36
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:29,479
That Bitemark Man is your cure.

37
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,879
I will find him for you.

38
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,400
Listen to me.

39
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,240
Wherever he is,

40
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,879
find him,

41
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,479
consume him,

42
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,039
and live.

43
00:02:48,070 --> 00:02:50,070
(Seven Days Earlier)

44
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,840
These Demon Essences

45
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,479
should be enough to get me

46
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,759
to Yu Linjun's Ninghua Palace.

47
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:01,439
Are you sure Yu Linjun

48
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,599
is the Bitemark Man you are looking for?

49
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:06,400
Would eating him really break the Curse?

50
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,319
My sister sent word not long ago.

51
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:12,240
She's certain the Bitemark Man
is Yu Linjun.

52
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:17,879
I wonder how your sister is doing
at the Ninghua Palace.

53
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,039
Godmother.

54
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,280
I'll bring her back.

55
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:24,479
My child,

56
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,439
remember this.

57
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:29,280
Never reveal that you are
the Divine Stone.

58
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,280
Once you reach the Palace,

59
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,439
watch and wait.

60
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,639
(To reach Ninghua Palace,)

61
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,520
(one must cross the Uncrossable Ferry.)

62
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,960
(The Ferry is swarming
with vengeful spirits.)

63
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,719
(No spells or powers can be used there.)

64
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,520
(Only a demon's body can endure it.)

65
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,599
(If your demon heart wavers,)

66
00:03:49,879 --> 00:03:51,319
(you will perish,)

67
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,159
(your soul lost among the dead forever.)

68
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,240
Lanxi.

69
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:16,240
(A spell?)

70
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,000
(Lanxi.)

71
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,560
(Is that you?)

72
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,600
(Your Majesty,)

73
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,000
(a young demoness begs an audience.)

74
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:41,600
(She says she's the Saintess's sister.)

75
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:44,399
Where is my sister?

76
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:48,519
She kept calling your name

77
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:52,600
right up until I ate her.

78
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,759
She was so sweet.

79
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,439
And you

80
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,959
make my mouth water as well.

81
00:05:02,639 --> 00:05:04,279
Once I feast on you,

82
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:07,879
I'll send you to join her in death.

83
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,920
You will pay with your life!

84
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:16,560
The Saintesses were my playthings,
my meals.

85
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,720
They wanted immortality,

86
00:05:18,839 --> 00:05:21,720
so I gave them immortality.

87
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,040
But you are special.

88
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:28,399
So I'll string you up
on the Sacred Tree.

89
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,519
(It turns out
every ornate ornament here)

90
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,079
(is a girl he killed.)

91
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,439
I'll make you

92
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:40,600
pay with your life!

93
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:45,199
I will make all of Ninghua Palace
pay for my sister!

94
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,519
Miss,

95
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,879
I think you have the wrong person.

96
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:51,879
No, I don't.

97
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,839
You look exactly like my sister.

98
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:55,160
I could never mistake that.

99
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,600
One gold.

100
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:13,240
I was born here in the Wilds of Lize.

101
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,040
I've never set foot outside.

102
00:06:16,199 --> 00:06:17,000
That is impossible.

103
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,800
How could there be such a coincidence?

104
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,720
Hmm.

105
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,720
Ask anything you want, goddess.

106
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:28,800
I may not have much else,

107
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:29,920
but I've got plenty of money.

108
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,079
(We are both demons.)

109
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,199
(You can enter my Demon Essence memory)

110
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:49,040
(and see for yourself.)

111
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,720
(I am not the one you seek.)

112
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,120
I was wrong.

113
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,480
It's okay.

114
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,639
I'm here with you.

115
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,480
It is all right. I am here too.

116
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:14,680
That is right. We are all here.

117
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,199
Sister.

118
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,639
I'm here.

119
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:19,560
I'm here too.

120
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,639
I'm here too.

121
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:24,079
Hehehe.

122
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,639
Hehe.

123
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,879
I'm here too.

124
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:56,798
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

125
00:07:57,070 --> 00:08:00,243
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

126
00:08:00,284 --> 00:08:03,798
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

127
00:08:03,984 --> 00:08:06,918
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

128
00:08:07,198 --> 00:08:13,968
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

129
00:08:14,614 --> 00:08:21,302
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

130
00:08:22,208 --> 00:08:25,878
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

131
00:08:25,988 --> 00:08:29,678
♪I shatter the hollow fate
they wrote for me♪

132
00:08:29,850 --> 00:08:36,084
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
